     2470       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 98.63 BY 20.
     2471   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2472        b-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
     2473        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 9
     2474        b-restore AT ROW 1 COL 17
     2475        b-clear-last-date AT ROW 1 COL 31
     2476        b-set-last-date AT ROW 1 COL 41
     2477        b-set-from-old AT ROW 1 COL 51
     2478        b-set-from-income AT ROW 1 COL 63
     2479        b-sch AT ROW 1 COL 75
