     2481        RS-filter AT ROW 2.46 COL 13 NO-LABEL
     2482        BROWSE-1 AT ROW 3.75 COL 1
     2483        FILL-IN-4 AT ROW 2.54 COL 1.25 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     2484        rect-flt AT ROW 1.04 COL 75.13
     2485        SPACE(12.62) SKIP(21.42)
     2486       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
     2487            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
     2488            TITLE "Редактирование сроков годности партий товара"
     2489            CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
     2490   ASSIGN
     2491          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
     2492          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
